message: >-
  QUDT is licensed under CC BY 4.0, which requires attribution to QUDT.org.
  The following citation satisfies that requirement. Please include the QUDT
  release version you used.
title: "QUDT — Quantities, Units, Dimensions and Types"
abstract: >-
  The QUDT ontologies define quantity kinds, units of measure, dimension
  vectors, physical constants and data types, for use in RDF, SHACL and OWL.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "QUDT.org"
    website: "https://qudt.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/qudt/qudt-public-repo"
url: "https://qudt.org"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - units of measure
  - quantity kinds
  - dimensions
  - ontology
  - RDF
  - SHACL
